00:09:33.578 --> 00:09:34.577
with full bar.


00:09:34.578 --> 00:09:36.512
Let me grab a shower and
I'll meet you there.


00:09:36.513 --> 00:09:37.802
Okay.


00:10:16.653 --> 00:10:20.855
Kurt Sloane?
US Marshall services.


00:10:23.427 --> 00:10:24.785
