you killed someone.


00:10:48.419 --> 00:10:49.845
This is for Eric.


00:10:53.690 --> 00:10:55.658
Maybe you forgot.


00:10:55.659 --> 00:11:00.726
About 18 months
ago over in Thailand? No?


00:11:02.433 --> 00:11:03.825
That was self-defense.


00:11:04.668 --> 00:11:06.702
Ah. Well, that's good.


00:11:07.103 --> 00:11:10.103
That's the kind of stuff that you want
to tell the judge once you get there.


00:11:11.442 --> 00:11:13.082
We were just told about
getting you there.


00:11:14.545 --> 00:11:15.903
Can I see that badge again?


00:11:16.513 --> 00:11:17.837
Sure.


00:12:03.660 --> 00:12:05.757
Welcome back.


00:12:10.967 --> 00:12:15.802
Shock and aw!
Just like you feeling now!


00:12:18.542 --> 00:12:21.902
The man who killed Tong Po.


00:12:26.416 --> 00:12:32.787
The odds for an American
beach boy were astronomical.


00:12:35.359 --> 00:12:37.950
You will be joining with
him in hell shortly


00:12:38.428 --> 00:12:39.917
Maybe.


00:12:42.733 --> 00:12:45.768
What I need it was for
you to take his place


00:12:45.769 --> 00:12:50.972
As the next big attraction.
That would have been...


00:12:51.842 --> 00:12:54.677
but you left Thailand.


00:12:56.847 --> 00:13:03.895
Today is when you find out...
It doesn't work that way, does it?


00:13:04.095 --> 00:13:07.690
It is time for you to defend your title.


00:13:07.691 --> 00:13:11.154
In another fight to the death.
Don't you think?


00:13:11.695 --> 00:13:13.121
Never again.


00:13:25.709 --> 00:13:28.000
You are not smart enough to let me go.


00:13:33.884 --> 00:13:37.017
You touch me again,
and I will break your nose.


00:13:50.667 --> 00:13:52.958
The sense of humor.


00:13:56.706 --> 00:13:57.995
Stop!


00:14:09.653 --> 00:14:11.045
This guy.


00:14:11.688 --> 00:14:14.115
One more fight to death.


00:14:14.658 --> 00:14:16.725
Against the current champion.


00:14:16.726 --> 00:14:20.154
That's all I am asking! "Voila"!


00:14:49.626 --> 00:14:52.087
Step in to the ring with Mongkut.


00:14:52.863 --> 00:14:57.065
I will pay you 1 million American dollars.


00:14:59.669 --> 00:15:01.937
Tax-free.


00:15:02.639 --> 00:15:05.066
Or you spend the rest
of your life in prison.


00:15:08.879 --> 00:15:11.814
Without the possibility
of ever getting out.


00:15:11.815 --> 00:15:16.785
Just remember, the man in this
prison loved Tong Po.


00:15:16.786 --> 00:15:20.112
They know who you are.
Surprises and fears.


00:17:08.632 --> 00:17:10.024
They are making a move on you.


00:17:17.774 --> 00:17:19.166
I got this.


00:17:26.850 --> 00:17:29.050
You better call the prison doctor.


00:17:29.853 --> 00:17:33.088
Tell him there is three
broken ribs and a punctured lung.


00:17:35.459 --> 00:17:39.190
Dislocated jaw and a broken nose.


00:22:13.670 --> 00:22:16.131
That was not too good, was it?


00:22:16.673 --> 00:22:21.933
One day in the general population
and already in some sort of trouble.


00:22:23.880 --> 00:22:30.141
You are not going to make it, Mr Sloane.
At least not like this.


00:22:31.033 --> 00:22:35.757
Behind these walls,
you will have fight to the death everyday.


00:22:37.358 --> 00:22:40.051
So why not just take the money?


00:22:41.431 --> 00:22:44.092
When you'll agree to fight for me,


00:22:44.600 --> 00:22:49.064
You will instantly call from
choking on your own vomit.


00:22:49.239 --> 00:22:54.967
To comfort well, and provocative
sensual amusement.


00:23:01.784 --> 00:23:03.073
Kurt.


00:23:04.854 --> 00:23:10.057
Are you in there?
You with me on this?


00:23:10.760 --> 00:23:16.020
When you were kid,
did you get your ass kicked much?


00:23:19.602 --> 00:23:21.995
You look so much better with
that nose I give you.


00:23:24.874 --> 00:23:29.907
I do love your spirit.
I hate to waste it.


00:23:36.786 --> 00:23:41.989
Can you believe she actually
sent me this picture?


00:23:44.794 --> 00:23:46.959
Wow, that's crazy!


00:24:10.520 --> 00:24:11.820
- Hello?
- Honey, it's me.


00:24:11.821 --> 00:24:13.855
Kurt. Where... where are you?
What happened?


00:24:13.856 --> 00:24:15.857
- I've been going crazy here.
- I've been kidnapped.


00:24:15.858 --> 00:24:17.389
I am outside of Bangkok in a prison.


00:24:17.589 --> 00:24:21.129
Kidnapped? Kurt!
Where are you?


00:25:29.699 --> 00:25:31.733
You interrupted my meditation.


00:25:31.734 --> 00:25:34.935
Meditation, really?
Does that help you to stay calm?


00:25:37.707 --> 00:25:39.875
I'm calm. Very calm.


00:25:39.876 --> 00:25:41.939
I guess not.


00:27:43.599 --> 00:27:46.094
I keep my fist fast and hard.


00:27:46.669 --> 00:27:49.028
Ready to break anything that it hits.


00:28:52.768 --> 00:28:57.772
What is important that could not
be said at the police station.


00:28:57.969 --> 00:28:59.793
I do not feel safe
at the police station.


00:28:59.993 --> 00:29:01.465
What could possibly be safer than that?


00:29:01.489 --> 00:29:02.555
I need your help.


00:29:03.212 --> 00:29:05.542
A few years ago, when you were a cop
you investigated us.


00:29:06.149 --> 00:29:08.440
And now you want our help?


00:29:09.018 --> 00:29:12.185
Tell me where my husband is.
Here's the payment.


00:29:18.427 --> 00:29:20.530
He is being held at the
northern jail facility


00:29:21.019 --> 00:29:22.215
for the murder of Tong Po.


00:29:22.323 --> 00:29:26.568
- Who is responsible for this?
- Thomas Tang more, a fight promoter.


00:29:28.504 --> 00:29:32.093
You did not hear that from me.


00:29:32.193 --> 00:29:33.677
Get him released.


00:29:33.777 --> 00:29:35.571
You do not have that much money.


00:29:41.696 --> 00:29:44.565
Follow her.
Tell me where she goes.


00:30:01.037 --> 00:30:04.329
That's the way they have implemented
the attitude adjustment.


00:30:11.114 --> 00:30:15.077
I want what you got.
You took the lash without a whimper.


00:30:15.684 --> 00:30:17.008
Over here.


00:30:20.790 --> 00:30:24.958
Every day I want you to come
down here and grab this plant.


00:30:28.831 --> 00:30:30.865
Deaden the nerves.


00:30:30.866 --> 00:30:32.834
Put it on your back at night.


00:30:32.835 --> 00:30:35.069
The rest will have to do with your mind.


00:30:50.786 --> 00:30:52.887
- Can you walk?
- Maybe.


00:30:52.888 --> 00:30:55.207
C'mon. Behind the wall.


00:30:55.407 --> 00:30:58.159
You will never fight the same way again.
Trust me.


00:31:48.677 --> 00:31:50.001
Durand.


00:31:57.252 --> 00:31:58.881
Kurt.


00:32:04.827 --> 00:32:06.151
What are you doing here?


00:32:06.762 --> 00:32:08.663
Training fighters.


00:32:08.664 --> 00:32:09.764
Here? Why?


00:32:09.765 --> 00:32:13.768
Because I was accused to participate
in the murder of Tong Po.


00:32:13.769 --> 00:32:15.127
Can you believe that?


00:32:15.738 --> 00:32:17.538
And also I wont give you up.


00:32:17.740 --> 00:32:22.977
So Mr. Moore blind me.


00:32:23.846 --> 00:32:27.013
Don't get sentimental.
It is a blessing.


00:32:31.620 --> 00:32:32.754
How is any of this a blessing?


00:32:32.755 --> 00:32:36.658
Being able to use my sense
without the eyes...


00:32:36.659 --> 00:32:40.087
It's a blessing. Being able to know the
answer before the question.


00:32:40.829 --> 00:32:42.892
It's a blessing..


00:32:48.804 --> 00:32:50.969
Don't look in my eyes.


00:32:56.879 --> 00:32:58.942
You are not alone.


00:33:04.687 --> 00:33:07.979
After 2 weeks we have made
absolutely no progress.


00:33:09.658 --> 00:33:13.695
Yeah, we have to find a way to act this up.


00:33:13.696 --> 00:33:16.931
And see our adamant and condition to fight


00:33:17.366 --> 00:33:19.901
We can all, dismay him later...


00:33:20.102 --> 00:33:23.035
Once we get bored with this.


00:33:25.708 --> 00:33:28.033
Are you ready to listen to me now?


00:33:28.844 --> 00:33:33.012
I know this guy.
I know how to break him.


00:33:43.892 --> 00:33:46.894
Hey. You rang?


00:33:46.895 --> 00:33:48.830
Thanks for coming.


00:33:48.831 --> 00:33:51.799
Are you kidding?


00:33:51.800 --> 00:33:54.068
So what have you been doing?


00:33:54.670 --> 00:33:57.131
Working for a private investigator,


00:33:57.406 --> 00:34:00.033
looking for deadbeat dads.


00:34:00.909 --> 00:34:03.040
I'm looking for my husband.


00:34:07.750 --> 00:34:09.817
I think he's in the northern jail.


00:34:09.818 --> 00:34:11.786
I also need you to get to the kidnapper.


00:34:11.787 --> 00:34:14.078
This guy's name is
Thomas Tang Moore.


00:34:14.723 --> 00:34:16.957
I know he's got more
money than God.


00:34:17.826 --> 00:34:20.094
Well, it's not about the ransom money.


00:34:20.429 --> 00:34:21.796
Let me keep over some stats.


00:34:21.797 --> 00:34:23.798
I'll meet you back here in two hours.


00:34:23.799 --> 00:34:25.191
Okay. thanks.


00:34:25.768 --> 00:34:28.059
Don't worry.
We'll find him!


00:35:07.710 --> 00:35:09.170
My man Kurt Sloane.


00:35:18.320 --> 00:35:20.114
I still owe you two broken ribs.


00:35:20.422 --> 00:35:24.859
I may have deserved that.
But I am just here to talk to you.


00:35:24.860 --> 00:35:26.923
The answer is still no.


00:35:27.429 --> 00:35:28.987
Is it now?


00:35:30.733 --> 00:35:34.935
In that case, I have something
you might want to see.


00:35:45.681 --> 00:35:46.714
If you touch her...


00:35:46.715 --> 00:35:48.355
I am not the one you have to worry about.


00:35:48.617 --> 00:35:50.077
You know what he wants.


00:35:57.726 --> 00:36:03.896
Now... are you willing
to talk to Mr Moore?


00:36:19.681 --> 00:36:21.141
Did you just say yes?


00:36:21.817 --> 00:36:23.141
Yeah.


00:36:25.421 --> 00:36:26.854
What else they can do to you?


00:36:26.855 --> 00:36:28.918
They got my wife.


00:36:35.697 --> 00:36:38.989
I am so excited about the fight.


00:36:39.668 --> 00:36:43.904
This is a fight
I will pay to see.


00:36:44.406 --> 00:36:46.168
Well, obviously.


00:36:47.743 --> 00:36:49.169
I have my conditions.


00:36:52.681 --> 00:36:57.318
You may not have any contact
with her or anyone else...


00:36:57.319 --> 00:36:58.943
until the fight.


00:36:59.655 --> 00:37:03.118
But we can show you
she's very well cared for.


00:37:03.692 --> 00:37:04.792
If anybody hurts her...


00:37:04.793 --> 00:37:08.796
We die! We all die!
You die!


00:37:08.797 --> 00:37:10.928
Not you. You...


00:37:38.660 --> 00:37:40.120
You have to feel yourself.


00:37:44.433 --> 00:37:46.025
The air moves.


00:37:48.637 --> 00:37:49.992
Before it moves.


00:37:51.821 --> 00:37:53.146
Because...


00:37:55.844 --> 00:37:57.312
You are him.


00:37:58.521 --> 00:38:00.774
Use his force as yours.


00:38:01.850 --> 00:38:03.981
Anticipation.


00:38:06.322 --> 00:38:08.082
Hidden anticipation.


00:38:47.796 --> 00:38:49.648
No, put your weight behind.


00:38:49.799 --> 00:38:52.896
That, come on.


00:38:56.738 --> 00:38:58.972
You gotta get past him first.


00:39:01.777 --> 00:39:03.942
Have faith in your ability.


00:39:11.853 --> 00:39:14.178
Tell me when you start to feel
it coming close to you.


00:39:17.993 --> 00:39:19.299
Now.


00:39:19.399 --> 00:39:20.923
Take off the blind fold.


00:39:23.598 --> 00:39:25.058
Too late to do anything.


00:39:37.813 --> 00:39:39.944
Well that didn't work.


00:39:40.649 --> 00:39:41.849
How is your training going?


00:39:41.850 --> 00:39:43.174
He's getting it.


00:39:43.318 --> 00:39:46.292
Oh, yeah? Maybe he'll
never get it, you know?


00:39:46.392 --> 00:39:47.688
Oh, he got it in him.


00:39:47.689 --> 00:39:50.150
Listen, Briggs.
I know his skills.


00:39:50.792 --> 00:39:52.727
And he may never be that good.


00:39:52.728 --> 00:39:55.863
He will beat Mongkut.
Guaranteed.


00:39:55.864 --> 00:39:57.798
You mention Mongkut one more time,


00:39:57.799 --> 00:39:59.767
then I'll smash your big face.


00:39:59.768 --> 00:40:01.126
Oh really?


00:40:44.746 --> 00:40:45.813
Do you see what I mean?


00:40:45.814 --> 00:40:47.172
He is blind as a bat.


00:40:49.751 --> 00:40:51.143
No more jail!


00:40:51.787 --> 00:40:58.087
You will train in the comfort
of my luxurious suburb compound.


00:41:01.797 --> 00:41:06.056
So just sit back and enjoy the ride.


00:41:08.770 --> 00:41:10.704
I need my trainer, Durand.


00:41:10.705 --> 00:41:12.973
And I still need to train
with my prison crew.


00:41:13.708 --> 00:41:16.169
I am here to help.
Done!


00:41:16.812 --> 00:41:18.645
I'll need a field trip
for and exhibition fight


00:41:18.646 --> 00:41:19.946
when I am ready.


00:41:21.750 --> 00:41:23.915
I love this guy.


00:41:50.679 --> 00:41:51.912
You have to start the training.


00:41:51.913 --> 00:41:53.848
Start?
Start.


00:41:53.849 --> 00:42:00.149
Start the focus.
And to forget everything else.


00:42:02.757 --> 00:42:04.081
It's kind of hard.


00:42:04.759 --> 00:42:06.827
They kidnapped your wife.


00:42:06.828 --> 00:42:11.064
You have to fight big monster.


00:42:11.633 --> 00:42:12.991
Let's laugh about it.
Ha ha.


00:42:15.704 --> 00:42:19.167
Let's go back to the
business and get focused.


00:42:20.775 --> 00:42:25.102
Your strength against its weakness.


00:42:26.615 --> 00:42:31.978
It's your speed and your flexibility.
Dexterity.


00:42:37.626 --> 00:42:38.726
What's his weakness?


00:42:38.727 --> 00:42:40.961
That's a good question, Kurt.


00:42:42.764 --> 00:42:44.899
I would like to see Mongkut training.


00:42:44.900 --> 00:42:48.636
How do you see anything?
You are blind.


00:42:48.637 --> 00:42:52.100
Well, then you have nothing to worry about.
I just want to see him..


00:43:02.717 --> 00:43:04.177
Meet Mongkut.


00:43:04.719 --> 00:43:07.039
State of the art miracle of
bioengineering killing machine


00:43:08.924 --> 00:43:12.693
A fighter bred from generation of fighters.


00:43:12.694 --> 00:43:15.087
With the top modern chemistry.


00:43:18.767 --> 00:43:23.197
By the sound of his breathing, he sound
like a rhinoceros. Right?


00:43:25.807 --> 00:43:29.777
His handler graduated
Cambridge top of his class.


00:43:29.778 --> 00:43:34.014
Went right to work for Mr Moore
for mil a year.


00:43:40.955 --> 00:43:42.790
What is he doing?


00:43:42.791 --> 00:43:44.792
An adrenaline cocktail.


00:43:44.793 --> 00:43:47.118
This is not the way.
You know this.


00:43:47.862 --> 00:43:52.800
There is no drug testing for
illegal underground fights right?


00:43:52.801 --> 00:43:57.094
This is not the martial art.
It's not the truth.


00:44:22.864 --> 00:44:26.667
Mongkut is a superior
human specimen.


00:44:26.668 --> 00:44:28.869
Greater faster.


00:44:28.870 --> 00:44:31.934
Stronger than any human being
on the planet.


00:44:52.093 --> 00:44:54.889
Everything okay with your champion?


00:44:55.497 --> 00:44:57.089
Oh, yeah. He is fine.


00:44:57.599 --> 00:44:59.123
Oh yeah.


00:45:44.679 --> 00:45:46.139
Let Kurt live.


00:45:48.817 --> 00:45:50.141
I beg you.


00:45:54.856 --> 00:46:00.059
What about this?
I fight Mongkut instead of Kurt.


00:46:02.697 --> 00:46:04.157
Well, it will be exciting, no?


00:46:04.632 --> 00:46:07.025
That would be exciting.


00:46:07.469 --> 00:46:08.902
You got quite a follow on.


00:46:08.903 --> 00:46:10.966
This is true.


00:46:12.440 --> 00:46:15.067
One problem. You are blind.


00:46:31.693 --> 00:46:32.860
Maybe blind..


00:46:32.861 --> 00:46:35.829
With the sensation I can see
ugliest man in the world.


00:46:35.830 --> 00:46:38.155
The strongest man in the world.


00:46:47.809 --> 00:46:49.843
Yes, of course, forgive me.


00:46:49.844 --> 00:46:53.881
But to see blind men fighting...
will make a fortune. No?


00:46:53.882 --> 00:46:57.151
That is a really exciting prospect.


00:46:57.719 --> 00:47:01.011
But of course, I don't
really need the money.


00:47:10.899 --> 00:47:12.996
Cancel this fight.


00:47:13.668 --> 00:47:17.927
You really thought you could
appeal to my better nature...?


00:47:19.441 --> 00:47:20.999
Good bye.


00:48:07.455 --> 00:48:11.083
You have to learn how to fly.


00:48:34.682 --> 00:48:36.783
The strongest man
does not always win.


00:48:36.784 --> 00:48:39.018
But the smartest one does.


00:48:50.698 --> 00:48:52.056
Not bad.


00:49:19.093 --> 00:49:20.888
Thanks.


00:49:21.829 --> 00:49:24.865
- I am a friend of Liu's
- What?


00:49:24.866 --> 00:49:26.800
She told me you're here.


00:49:26.801 --> 00:49:30.002
And they took her.
I am here to help you.


00:49:34.742 --> 00:49:36.942
Okay. Higher than that.


00:49:38.446 --> 00:49:40.038
High. Kick high.


00:49:43.418 --> 00:49:45.686
Higher than that.
He's 6 feet 10. C'mon.


